# QA (M1 acceptance): the whole M1 flow in one run of the real game on
# Stage 1. Title, START (21) -> stage intro -> play (from 172) -> the
# Hanuschplatz checkpoint -> over the house steps into tourist pair A: deaths
# at 1183, 1714, 2245, each followed by the dying pause, the stage intro and
# a respawn at the checkpoint -> GameOver (2305) -> START (2411, accepted
# 60 frames into the game over) restarts the stage from its start -> the
# solver route unchanged (a continue is a clean restart: the route still
# completes 1601 frames after play starts) -> Maibaum, tally, stage clear,
# „Fortsetzung folgt …" -> back on the title with the run reset.
# The route is pinned to Salzburg alone (D-047 `route`): since St. Gilgen
# ships, the standard route would continue to the route map instead.
level  = salzburg
route  = salzburg
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = event=CheckpointReached event=Respawned event=GameOver deaths=3
expect = complete frames=4161..4161 state=title score=0 lives=3
